{:id :EACL-FORMAL-013
 :status :fixed
 :discovered-by :manual-review
 :seed-or-trace "subproblem-cache/resolve-own-key/lookup-own-flight"
 :minimized-fixture "fixture.edn"
 :impact :availability
 :affected-versions ["PR 101 worktree before lifecycle-qualified lookup self-detection"]
 :affected-backends [:shared :datomic :datascript :datahike]
 :root-cause
 "`resolve!` recorded active recursive ownership as `[lifecycle tier key]`, but `lookup!` tested `[tier key]`. A callback probing its own in-flight entry could therefore dereference its own unresolved delay instead of taking the documented recursive-self miss."
 :fix
 "The final v8 cache has no registered flights. Read-only lookup never starts work; identical misses compute independently and can only race bounded nonblocking publication, so self-wait is structurally impossible."
